    "Scan of the 1965 edition of the Naples, Utah, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the Bureau of Reclamation. Surveyed in 1955; aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1965; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1979.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
